irror_qc_report", "txt", true], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 5004, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "output_file_path"}, "name": "output_file_path", "label": "output_file_path", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_file_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_name"}, "name": "file_name", "label": "file_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "file_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_extension"}, "name": "file_extension", "label": "file_extension", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "file_extension"}, {"widget": {"name": "overwrite"}, "name": "overwrite", "label": "overwrite", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "overwrite"}], "flags": {}, "id": 52, "type": "easy saveText", "title": "输出=文本", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy saveText"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [5004], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [332.86572265625, 964.2010498046875], "pos": [2107.47314453125, -558.5621337890625], "widgets_values": ["# Video QA Inspection Report\n\nFinal Score: 35/100\nGate: FAIL\n\n# Evaluation Table\n\n| Dimension | Score | Observations |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Identity Consistency | 90 | Facial features, hair, and clothing remain highly stable throughout the clip. |\n| Mirror Geometry | 10 | Severe hallucination. The foreground subject's back and the physical mirror frame completely dissolve after the first frame. |\n| Hand/Phone Anatomy | 75 | Phone structure and finger placement are mostly acceptable, with minor edge warping. |\n| Background Stability | 40 | The environment structure breaks down as the scene transitions from a reflected background to a direct background due to the disappearing mirror frame. |\n| Camera Stability | 30 | Unintended spatial shifting destroys the original composition and depth of field. |\n| Motion Naturalness | 60 | Subject motion is extremely limited, appearing rigid and lacking natural breathing or subtle dynamics. |\n\n# Top 3 Issues\n\n1. Complete loss of mirror physics. The physical mirror frame and the foreground body dissolve, turning a mirror selfie into a direct portrait of someone covering their face with a phone.\n2. Invalid spatial perspective. The initial frame attempts an over-the-shoulder view, which physically contradicts a mirror reflection where the phone lens must be the focal point.\n3. Unstable scene composition. The generation fails to maintain the foreground-background layer separation, collapsing the physical depth of the environment.\n\n# Prompt Fix Suggestions\n\nPositive Prompt: 1girl, solo, authentic mirror selfie, holding smartphone, visible mirror edges, reflection only, static camera, locked composition, seamless background continuity.\n\nNegative Prompt: foreground person, third-person view, over the shoulder, disappearing objects, morphing environment, zooming camera, changing perspective, multiple people."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 5003, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 21, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 4}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-1216.3408145019966, 772.9761025872874], "scale": 0.7247295000000027}}, "groups": [], "links": [[5001, 67, 0, 243, 0, "VIDEO"], [5002, 58, 0, 243, 2, "STRING"], [5003, 243, 0, 21, 0, "STRING"], [5004, 21, 0, 52, 0, "STRING"]], "id": "6fa8d87a-62ae-4791-bd4d-7